ientific Meetings</td>\n103: <td>Dr. Benjamin Okonkwo</td>\n104: <td>Strategy</td>\n105: </tr>\n106: <tr>\n107: <td>11:30–12:15</td>\n108: <td>Harbor Room</td>\n109: <td>Incident Response Tabletop: Coordinating Volunteers, Vendors and Venue Teams</td>\n110: <td>María-José Castellanos</td>\n111: <td>Workshop</td>\n112: </tr>\n113: <tr>\n114: <td>13:15–14:00</td>\n115: <td>Main Hall</td>\n116: <td>Open Data Partnerships: Practical Lessons from International Research Networks</td>\n117: <td>Dr. Evelyn Chen-Laurent</td>\n118: <td>Research</td>\n119: </tr>\n120: <tr>\n121: <td>14:00–14:45</td>\n122: <td>Harbor Room</td>\n123: <td>Making Hybrid Participation Feel Equitable for Remote and On-Site Delegates</td>\n124: <td>Mohammed Al-Hassan</td>\n125: <td>Experience</td>\n126: </tr>\n127: <tr>\n128: <td>15:00–15:45</td>\n129: <td>Main Hall</td>\n130: <td>Closing Panel: Sustainable Growth Without Losing Community Trust</td>\n131: <td>Dr. Sophie van der Meer</td>\n132: <td>All delegates</td>\n133: </tr>\n134: </tbody>\n135: </table>\n136: </section>\n137: <section id=\"registration\">\n138: <h2>Registration summary</h2>\n139: <div class=\"summary-row\">\n140: <span>Standard passes</span>\n141: <b>864</b>\n142: </div>\n143: <div class=\"summary-row\">\n144: <span>Student passes</span>\n145: <b>276</b>\n146: </div>\n147: <div class=\"summary-row\">\n148: <span>Speaker / partner</span>\n149: <b>108</b>\n150: </div>\n151: <div class=\"summary-row\">\n152: <span>Awaiting payment</span>\n153: <b>32</b>\n154: </div>\n155: <p class=\"pill\">Registration desk: OPEN</p>\n156: <p class=\"note\">Desk hours: 07:30–17:30<br>Help desk: Harbor Foyer, Level 1<br>Accessibility support: ask any desk volunteer.</p>\n157: </section>\n158: </div>\n159: <footer id=\"footer\">\n160: <span>Operations status: All systems operational</span>\n161: <span>Last updated 08:15 · Next briefing 12:30</span>\n162: </footer>\n163: </main>\n164: </body>\n165: </html>\n\n(End of file - total 165 lines)\n</content>